mṛṇ-ā-la, n. [liable to be crushed], 🞄esculent tubular fibrous root of the lotus, 🞄lotus fibre: -ka, —˚ a. id.;
 -bhañjam, abs. w. 🞄bhañj, break like a lotus root;
 -maya, a. 🞄consisting of lotus roots;
 -latikā, f. lotus 🞄tendril or stalk;
 -vat, a. possessing lotus 🞄fibres;
 -sūtra, n. fibre of the lotus stalk or 🞄root.
